# AWS Storage Services Benchmark v1.0.0
# 3.12 - Ensure configuring IAM for disaster recovery

META
    esp_id `aws-stor-3-12`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `aws`
    criticality `medium`
    control_mapping `NIST-800-53:AC-2,NIST-800-53:AC-3,KSI:KSI-AFR-ADS,KSI:KSI-CED-RGT`
    title `3.12 - Ensure configuring IAM for disaster recovery`
    description `Verify backup role is configured for cross-region disaster recovery.`
    author `example-security`
    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    impl_AC_2 `3.12: Ensure configuring IAM for disaster recovery`
    impl_AC_3 `3.12: Ensure configuring IAM for disaster recovery`
    impl_AT_2 `3.12: Ensure configuring IAM for disaster recovery`
META_END

DEF
    OBJECT backup_role
        role_name `BACKUP_ROLE_NAME`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE backup_role_check
        found boolean = true
        attached_policy_count int >= 2
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN aws_iam_role
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF backup_role_check
            OBJECT_REF backup_role
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
